usage: plan.py reconcile [-h] [--plans-root PLANS_ROOT] [--actor ACTOR]
                         [--json]
                         plan

close phases whose items are all terminal, then the plan (integrator)

positional arguments:
  plan                  plan id, PLAN<N> or path

options:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
  --plans-root PLANS_ROOT
                        plans/ directory (default: nearest up from cwd)
  --actor ACTOR         PROVIDER/MODEL[/EFFORT] (default: plan authoring)
  --json
